# NAS Sync Schedule
# Format: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week command
#
# Replace the remote:path values with your actual share names.
# Run "docker exec nas-sync-cron rclone listremotes" to see configured remotes.
# Run "docker exec nas-sync-cron rclone lsd ugreen:" to list shares on Ugreen.
# Run "docker exec nas-sync-cron rclone lsd wdnas:" to list shares on WD NAS.
#
# Examples (uncomment and edit to activate):

# Mirror — runs daily at 2:00 AM
#0 2 * * * /scripts/mirror.sh ugreen:YOUR_SHARE wdnas:YOUR_SHARE

# One-way sync — runs every 6 hours
#0 */6 * * * /scripts/sync.sh ugreen:YOUR_SHARE wdnas:YOUR_SHARE

# Versioned backup — runs every Sunday at 3:00 AM
#0 3 * * 0 /scripts/backup.sh ugreen:YOUR_SHARE wdnas:YOUR_SHARE
